  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "7.0.0 - Cross-platform SkiaSharp API surface (SkiaTools, SkiaGraphicsTools, SkiaExtensionMethods). Target frameworks: netstandard2.0, net48, net8.0, net10.0. All System.Drawing APIs marked [Obsolete] with migration guidance. New SetImageAsync(SKBitmap) and SetImageAsync(byte[]) overloads. DrawTextLine extension for SKCanvas. TitleParameters cross-platform properties (FontFamilyName, TitleSKColor, TitleTypeface). See MIGRATION.md for the full migration guide.",
